@host = http://localhost:5057

### Issue a Stream user token (creates the user if missing; only sent fields are updated)
POST {{host}}/api/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "alice",
  "name": "Alice",
  "image": "https://getstream.io/random_png/?name=Alice"
}

### Refresh a token (userId only; leaves the existing user unchanged)
POST {{host}}/api/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "alice"
}

### Invalid request: returns 400 ValidationProblem
POST {{host}}/api/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "bad id!",
  "image": "ftp://example.com/alice.png"
}

### Ring bob with a video call from alice (bob gets an incoming call if connected)
POST {{host}}/api/calls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "createdById": "alice",
  "memberIds": ["bob"],
  "kind": "video"
}

### Ring bob with an audio call (the client keeps the camera off)
POST {{host}}/api/calls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "createdById": "alice",
  "memberIds": ["bob"],
  "kind": "audio"
}

### Who can I call?
GET {{host}}/api/users?limit=20

### Read a call's state (replace the id with one from POST /api/calls)
GET {{host}}/api/calls/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### End a call for everyone
POST {{host}}/api/calls/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/end

### Webhook events received since startup (development only)
GET {{host}}/api/webhooks/recent

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

###
